{"type":"message","id":"fb53ceb9","parentId":"a4a433d9","timestamp":"2026-05-20T17:22:24.085Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_566660049c574bcc8cc68436","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"/app/docs/help/faq.md:    - Bake system deps into the image with `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES`.\n/app/docs/install/docker.md:| `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES`              | Install extra apt packages during build (space-separated)             |\n/app/docs/install/docker.md:`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` during image build. The legacy\n/app/docs/install/docker.md:`OPENCLAW_DOCKER_APT_PACKAGES` name is still accepted.\n/app/docs/install/docker.md:    2. **Bake system deps**: `export OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"git curl jq\"`\n/app/docs/install/podman.md:- `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` -- install extra apt packages during image build (also accepts legacy `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_APT_PACKAGES`)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":412,"aggregated":"/app/docs/help/faq.md:    - Bake system deps into the image with `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES`.\n/app/docs/install/docker.md:| `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES`              | Install extra apt packages during build (space-separated)             |\n/app/docs/install/docker.md:`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` during image build. The legacy\n/app/docs/install/docker.md:`OPENCLAW_DOCKER_APT_PACKAGES` name is still accepted.\n/app/docs/install/docker.md:    2. **Bake system deps**: `export OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"git curl jq\"`\n/app/docs/install/podman.md:- `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` -- install extra apt packages during image build (also accepts legacy `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_APT_PACKAGES`)","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-wxlee"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779297744082}}
{"type":"message","id":"a10b280e","parentId":"fb53ceb9","timestamp":"2026-05-20T17:23:31.568Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great, let me fetch the relevant section of the Docker docs for a clearer picture.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_15a6410acb0b497997429caa","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"grep -B2 -A10 \"OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES\" /app/docs/install/docker.md 2>/dev/null"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"grep -B2 -A10 \\\"OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES\\\" /app/docs/install/docker.md 2>/dev/null\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779297744087,"responseId":"1e4d73c1663547a1b60713fb537531f8"}}
{"type":"message","id":"deba8c0b","parentId":"a10b280e","timestamp":"2026-05-20T17:23:31.606Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_15a6410acb0b497997429caa","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"| ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `OPENCLAW_IMAGE`                           | Use a remote image instead of building locally                        |\n| `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES`              | Install extra apt packages during build (space-separated)             |\n| `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES`              | Install extra Python packages during build (space-separated)          |\n| `OPENCLAW_EXTENSIONS`                      | Pre-install plugin dependencies at build time (space-separated names) |\n| `OPENCLAW_EXTRA_MOUNTS`                    | Extra host bind mounts (comma-separated `source:target[:opts]`)       |\n| `OPENCLAW_HOME_VOLUME`                     | Persist `/home/node` in a named Docker volume                         |\n| `OPENCLAW_SANDBOX`                         | Opt in to sandbox bootstrap (`1`, `true`, `yes`, `on`)                |\n| `OPENCLAW_SKIP_ONBOARDING`                 | Skip the interactive onboarding step (`1`, `true`, `yes`, `on`)       |\n| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_SOCKET`                   | Override Docker socket path                                           |\n| `OPENCLAW_DISABLE_BONJOUR`                 | Disable Bonjour/mDNS advertising (defaults to `1` for Docker)         |\n| `OPENCLAW_DISABLE_BUNDLED_SOURCE_OVERLAYS` | Disable bundled plugin source bind-mount overlays                     |\n| `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT`              | Shared OTLP/HTTP collector endpoint for OpenTelemetry export          |\n--\ncontainer without `brew`; those dependencies must be provided by a custom image\nor installed manually. For dependencies available from Debian packages, use\n`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` during image build. The legacy\n`OPENCLAW_DOCKER_APT_PACKAGES` name is still accepted.\nFor Python dependencies, use `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES`. This runs\n`python3 -m pip install --break-system-packages` during the image build, so pin\npackage versions and use only package indexes you trust.\n\nMaintainers can test bundled plugin source against a packaged image by mounting\none plugin source directory over its packaged source path, for example\n`OPENCLAW_EXTRA_MOUNTS=/path/to/fork/extensions/synology-chat:/app/extensions/synology-chat:ro`.\nThat mounted source directory overrides the matching compiled\n`/app/dist/extensions/synology-chat` bundle for the same plugin id.\n--\n\n    1. **Persist `/home/node`**: `export OPENCLAW_HOME_VOLUME=\"openclaw_home\"`\n    2. **Bake system deps**: `export OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"git curl jq\"`\n    3. **Bake Python deps**: `export OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES=\"requests==2.32.5 humanize==4.14.0\"`\n    4. **Bake Playwright Chromium**: `export OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1`\n    5. **Or install Playwright browsers into a persisted volume**:\n       ```bash\n       docker compose run --rm openclaw-cli \\\n         node /app/node_modules/playwright-core/cli.js install chromium\n       ```\n    6. **Persist browser downloads**: use `OPENCLAW_HOME_VOLUME` or\n       `OPENCLAW_EXTRA_MOUNTS`. OpenClaw auto-detects the Docker image's\n       Playwright-managed Chromium on Linux."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":17,"aggregated":"| ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `OPENCLAW_IMAGE`                           | Use a remote image instead of building locally                        |\n| `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES`              | Install extra apt packages during build (space-separated)             |\n| `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES`              | Install extra Python packages during build (space-separated)          |\n| `OPENCLAW_EXTENSIONS`                      | Pre-install plugin dependencies at build time (space-separated names) |\n| `OPENCLAW_EXTRA_MOUNTS`                    | Extra host bind mounts (comma-separated `source:target[:opts]`)       |\n| `OPENCLAW_HOME_VOLUME`                     | Persist `/home/node` in a named Docker volume                         |\n| `OPENCLAW_SANDBOX`                         | Opt in to sandbox bootstrap (`1`, `true`, `yes`, `on`)                |\n| `OPENCLAW_SKIP_ONBOARDING`                 | Skip the interactive onboarding step (`1`, `true`, `yes`, `on`)       |\n| `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_SOCKET`                   | Override Docker socket path                                           |\n| `OPENCLAW_DISABLE_BONJOUR`                 | Disable Bonjour/mDNS advertising (defaults to `1` for Docker)         |\n| `OPENCLAW_DISABLE_BUNDLED_SOURCE_OVERLAYS` | Disable bundled plugin source bind-mount overlays                     |\n| `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT`              | Shared OTLP/HTTP collector endpoint for OpenTelemetry export          |\n--\ncontainer without `brew`; those dependencies must be provided by a custom image\nor installed manually. For dependencies available from Debian packages, use\n`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES` during image build. The legacy\n`OPENCLAW_DOCKER_APT_PACKAGES` name is still accepted.\nFor Python dependencies, use `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES`. This runs\n`python3 -m pip install --break-system-packages` during the image build, so pin\npackage versions and use only package indexes you trust.\n\nMaintainers can test bundled plugin source against a packaged image by mounting\none plugin source directory over its packaged source path, for example\n`OPENCLAW_EXTRA_MOUNTS=/path/to/fork/extensions/synology-chat:/app/extensions/synology-chat:ro`.\nThat mounted source directory overrides the matching compiled\n`/app/dist/extensions/synology-chat` bundle for the same plugin id.\n--\n\n    1. **Persist `/home/node`**: `export OPENCLAW_HOME_VOLUME=\"openclaw_home\"`\n    2. **Bake system deps**: `export OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"git curl jq\"`\n    3. **Bake Python deps**: `export OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES=\"requests==2.32.5 humanize==4.14.0\"`\n    4. **Bake Playwright Chromium**: `export OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1`\n    5. **Or install Playwright browsers into a persisted volume**:\n       ```bash\n       docker compose run --rm openclaw-cli \\\n         node /app/node_modules/playwright-core/cli.js install chromium\n       ```\n    6. **Persist browser downloads**: use `OPENCLAW_HOME_VOLUME` or\n       `OPENCLAW_EXTRA_MOUNTS`. OpenClaw auto-detects the Docker image's\n       Playwright-managed Chromium on Linux.","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-wxlee"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779297811602}}
{"type":"message","id":"a013e5cb","parentId":"deba8c0b","timestamp":"2026-05-20T17:25:04.778Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have all the details about the OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES parameter. Let me give the user a concise answer.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**`OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES`** — 在 Docker/Podman 构建镜像时安装额外的 apt 软件包。\n\n**用法示例：**\n```bash\nexport OPENCLAW_IMAGE_APT_PACKAGES=\"git curl jq\"\n```\n\n**要点：**\n1. 值用空格分隔 package 名，构建时自动 `apt-get install`\n2. 取代了旧的 `OPENCLAW_DOCKER_APT_PACKAGES`（旧名仍兼容，但推荐用新的）\n3. 只对**构建时**生效，不像 `OPENCLAW_EXTRA_MOUNTS` 是运行时挂载\n4. 适用于需要在容器内装系统工具的场景（比如 git、curl、ffmpeg 等 Debian 包）\n\n与此配套的还有 `OPENCLAW_IMAGE_PIP_PACKAGES`（装 Python 包）和 `OPENCLAW_INSTALL_BROWSER=1`（装 Playwright Chromium）。\n\n简单说：**以前想往 Docker 镜像里塞系统工具没有标准姿势，现在有了。**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779297811608,"responseId":"ac62012f279a4815834ff907f5c2c402"}}
